									<h3 tabindex="0"><span class="title optClickTitle no-underline">The Impact of Macroeconomic News on Quote Adjustments, Noise, and Informational Volatility</span></h3>
								
							
							
							<div class="reference">
								Journal of Banking and Finance, Vol. 35, No. 10, 2011
							</div>
							
							<div class="note note-list">
								
								
